        "date": "2026-11-22T12:45:08Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(2d): support Do not touch protection on Engrave operations\n\nAdd OpType::Engrave to do_not_touch_applies and implement\nmachining2d::trace_avoid so Engrave toolpaths keep flutes, shank, and\nholder clear of protected faces and edge chains across cutting moves,\nplunges, retracts, and rapid links. Refuse by item name when no safe\ncutting room remains, preserve the baseline toolpath when no items\nare protected, update the MCP description and reference doc, and add\npinning tests in motion, app, and ui.\n\nFixes #3349",
